family: F3
grade: judge

--- prompt ---
Content elements on https://typo3-dev-mcp-bench.ddev.site/products render without any
of the bench_fixture markup — the custom card template is being ignored, and the page
falls back to default output.

Diagnose the root cause. Name the exact file and what is wrong with it. Do not fix it.

--- setup ---
# Drop the set dependency from the site. Nothing errors; the fixture's TypoScript
# simply never loads, so lib.contentElement.templateRootPaths.200 disappears.
# There is no log entry for this — it has to be found in configuration.
sed -i.bak '/^dependencies:/,/^errorHandling:/{/^dependencies:/d; /balatd\/bench-fixture/d;}' \
    config/sites/main/config.yaml
rm -f config/sites/main/config.yaml.bak
ddev exec vendor/bin/typo3 cache:flush >/dev/null 2>&1

--- oracle ---
echo "Root cause: config/sites/main/config.yaml no longer lists the site set balatd/bench-fixture under 'dependencies'."
echo "Without the set, the fixture's setup.typoscript is never loaded, so lib.contentElement.templateRootPaths.200 (EXT:bench_fixture/Resources/Private/Templates/) is missing and tt_content.benchfixture_card falls back to default rendering."
echo "Silent failure: nothing is written to any log."

--- check ---
exit 2
